<title>UK: Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn sets out recovery plan.</title>
<headline>Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn sets out recovery plan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish-US. drugs group Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc set out a number of initiatives to turn around its disappointing performance on Tuesday.</p>
<p>These included &quot;significant reallocation and additional investment&quot; in product launches and marketing.</p>
<p>It also announced a refocusing of its business, centred on the core prescription pharmaceuticals operations.</p>
</text>
